# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else), ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent) and ch. 7 (a hold's write lands in the tick of the firing): the counter reads the bundle named below it.
test the_bundle_is_read_above

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="go")
    1: Ui.Label(text="total 0")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    1: Ui.Label(text="total 3")
